<h1 data-copy-en="Ember" data-copy-zh="Ember">Ember</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Lair access, personal conversations, two dates and Furnace Discipline." data-copy-zh="私人巢穴入口、个人谈心、两项约会与熔炉之律。">Lair access, personal conversations, two dates and Furnace Discipline.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find Ember</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">Missing actions and useful checks</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">出现地点与时间</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">动作缺失时的检查</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Dungeon_Battle_Choices"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Automatic_Home_Scene_Chain"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Home_Heart-to-Hearts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Worth_the_Climb"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Nothing_Left_to_Guard"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="What_the_Fire_Wants"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Special_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Dates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Resort_Activities"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Sunset_Walk_Best_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Sunset_Walk_with_Ember"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="One-Time_Resort_Group_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="If_Progress_Stalls"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Ember — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/ember.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Ember — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/ember.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Ember — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Ember’s post-battle route includes ordinary visits, three personal heart-to-hearts and two optional dates. Her story details and the results of those conversations are left for the game.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Recruitment_and_Lair_Access"></span><h2>Where to find Ember</h2><p>Complete the floor 50 encounter in the dungeon. Recruitment occurs on the victory route before either optional post-battle choice: Beast 60 is not required to recruit her. With the Menagerie built, take its passage to Ember's Lair; the door requires Ember to be active as a worker. She is available in the lair all day.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Location</th><th scope="col">Portrait schedule</th><th scope="col">Condition</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Ember's Lair</th><td data-label="Portrait schedule">all day</td><td data-label="Condition"></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Windows refer to the time you start an action; the ending time is excluded.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Main-Story_Participation"></span><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Return for the automatic personal visits as the relationship rises through Stranger, Acknowledged(10), Known(25) and Acquaintance(50). The Friend(100) heart-to-heart follows the fourth visit. Continue her new lair visits before expecting the Close Friend(200) conversation, then do the later Close Friend and Crush(400) visits before the final personal heart-to-heart.</p><p>The First Feast requires the first heart-to-heart; The First Horizon requires the second. These dates add to the route without replacing the intervening personal visits.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Result / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Worth the Climb</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Ember's Lair; all day</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100); after The Shape She Chose</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min; −15 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">heart-to-heart; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The First Feast</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Ember's Lair; 10:00–16:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100); after Worth the Climb</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; $120; −30 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Nothing Left to Guard</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Ember's Lair; all day</td><td data-label="Requirements">Close Friend (200); after A Hundred Years of Footsteps / Worth the Climb</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min; −15 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">heart-to-heart; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The First Horizon</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Ember's Lair; 18:00–23:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Close Friend (200); after Nothing Left to Guard</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">150 min; −45 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">What the Fire Wants</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Ember's Lair; all day</td><td data-label="Requirements">Crush (400); after Fire Without Hunger / Nothing Left to Guard</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min; −15 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">heart-to-heart; once</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Daily_Home_Actions"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Worker_Visits_and_Training"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Crafted_Gifts_and_Worker_Upgrades"></span><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><p>Furnace Discipline requires Known (25), Communication 90 and 15 Energy available. It takes 45 minutes and grants Stamina +1 and 12 direct relationship points once; the Energy is not deducted. Sparring and Jewelry are separate relationship actions with their own daily limits.</p><p>Once recruited, Ember can use the normal worker training, equipment and resort systems. Their upgrades and vacation activities are described in the linked guides; no additional post-battle stat check is needed merely to start the lair relationship route.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Result / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Ember</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Ember's Lair; all day</td><td data-label="Requirements">Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">15 min</td><td data-label="Result / limit">5 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Jewelry</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Ember's Lair; all day</td><td data-label="Requirements">Known (25)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">10 min; Jewelry ×1</td><td data-label="Result / limit">2 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Spar with Ember</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Ember's Lair; all day</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acquaintance (50)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">45 min; −20 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">1 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Furnace Discipline</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Ember's Lair; all day</td><td data-label="Requirements">Known (25); Communication 90</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">45 min; requires 15 Energy available. Energy is not spent.</td><td data-label="Result / limit">Stamina +1; direct relationship +12; once</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><h2>Missing actions and useful checks</h2><p>If the lair door is absent, check the Menagerie and Ember’s active-worker status. If a later conversation is absent, return for the previous automatic visit at the needed relationship stage.</p><p>A date appearing does not prove that every later personal visit is complete. Keep enough Energy for its full quoted cost, and check the start window before travelling.</p></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><p><a href="game-systems-brothel.html">Brothel operations</a> · <a href="game-systems-brothel-stats-and-calculations.html">Worker calculations</a> · <a href="character-fernando.html">Fernando’s clothing</a> · <a href="game-systems-sirena-isle-resort.html">Resort vacations</a> · <a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">Relationships</a></p></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Dungeon_Battle_Choices"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Automatic_Home_Scene_Chain"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Home_Heart-to-Hearts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Worth_the_Climb"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Nothing_Left_to_Guard"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-What_the_Fire_Wants"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Special_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Dates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Resort_Activities"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Sunset_Walk_Best_Answers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Sunset_Walk_with_Ember"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-One-Time_Resort_Group_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-If_Progress_Stalls"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Ember 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/ember.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Ember 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/ember.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Ember 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Ember在战斗后的个人路线包含普通拜访、三次谈心与两项可选约会。人物经历和对话结果留在游戏中探索。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Recruitment_and_Lair_Access"></span><h2>出现地点与时间</h2><p>先完成地下城第50层的相应战斗。胜利路线会在两项可选战后选择之前完成招募，因此招募本身不要求兽性60。珍兽苑建成后，从中进入Ember的巢穴；门要求Ember当前为在职员工。她在巢穴中全天可见。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">地点</th><th scope="col">头像出现时间</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Ember的巢穴</th><td data-label="头像出现时间">全天</td><td data-label="条件"></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>时段按开始动作时判定，结束时间不包含在内。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Main-Story_Participation"></span><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>关系依次达到陌生人、已遇见（10）、已知（25）、相识（50）时，回巢穴查看自动个人事件。朋友（100）的首次谈心在第四次拜访之后；之后继续完成新出现的巢穴事件，再推进亲密朋友（200）的谈心，以及后续亲密朋友、迷恋（400）阶段的事件，最后开放第三次个人谈心。</p><p>第一次盛宴要求完成第一次谈心，第一道地平线要求第二次谈心。这两项约会用于补充路线，不能代替中间的个人拜访。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">动作</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">结果／限制</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">值得攀登</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Ember的巢穴; 全天</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100）；完成：她选择的形体</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60分钟；−15 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">谈心，一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">第一次盛宴</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Ember的巢穴; 10:00–16:00</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100）；完成：值得攀登</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120分钟；财富120；−30 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">无物可守</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Ember的巢穴; 全天</td><td data-label="条件">亲密朋友（200）；完成：百年脚步声、值得攀登</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60分钟；−15 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">谈心，一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">第一道地平线</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Ember的巢穴; 18:00–23:00</td><td data-label="条件">亲密朋友（200）；完成：无物可守</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">150分钟；−45 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">火所欲求</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Ember的巢穴; 全天</td><td data-label="条件">迷恋（400）；完成：不饥饿的火、无物可守</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60分钟；−15 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">谈心，一次性</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Daily_Home_Actions"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Worker_Visits_and_Training"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Crafted_Gifts_and_Worker_Upgrades"></span><h2>行动与奖励</h2><p>已知（25）、沟通90且备有15精力时，可进行熔炉之律：消耗45分钟，一次性增加耐力1点及12点直接关系，不扣除精力。切磋和送珠宝是不同的关系动作，各有自己的每日次数。</p><p>招募后也可使用普通员工培训、装备和度假村系统，详细升级与度假活动见相关指南。要开始巢穴里的关系路线，不需要额外通过战后的可选属性检查。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">动作</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">结果／限制</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">与 Ember 交谈</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Ember的巢穴; 全天</td><td data-label="条件">陌生人（0）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">15分钟</td><td data-label="结果／限制">5次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送珠宝</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Ember的巢穴; 全天</td><td data-label="条件">已知（25）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">10分钟；珠宝 ×1</td><td data-label="结果／限制">2次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">与 Ember 切磋</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Ember的巢穴; 全天</td><td data-label="条件">相识（50）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">45分钟；−20 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">1次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">熔炉之律</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Ember的巢穴; 全天</td><td data-label="条件">已知（25）；沟通90</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">45分钟；开始时需有15精力，不扣除精力。</td><td data-label="结果／限制">耐力 +1；直接关系+12；一次性</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><h2>动作缺失时的检查</h2><p>巢穴入口缺失时，检查珍兽苑是否建成，以及Ember是否在职。后续谈心缺失时，先回去完成对应阶段的前一次自动拜访。</p><p>出现约会并不代表后面的个人事件都已经完成。出发前保留足够精力，并检查可开始的时段。</p></section>
